      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“发表这则贴文的人根本不懂！\n火山反倒是以在地偶像为主！\n别装作一副自己是粉丝的样子！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba4e3cc2a9e6e85503038edbcbf5fb43b9e91e104f692d8d342412ca10907d76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
