        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0579e33de2d35fcc95bda467",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“也有像飞鹰子那样两者兼顾的例子嘛。\n可惜的是，她和飞鹰子那样的\n正统派路线有点不一样。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "609c2fff497754eccf162806d871533949a52cd78331856be37f81fbe89a0603",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
