    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6117dc306888b9e5900f2455",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我也是因为比赛认识火山的～\n要是她想当一个成功的偶像，\n我认为苫小牧要素反而会扯后腿，真可惜。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "44edce37f8e9d8d481be5934a8fc3e221e0962f212c1df73e27bb7f4a29c0a28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
