        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a9279ed846bc7d1d038f61c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“说真的我只喜欢看北港火山奔跑，\n对在地偶像活动什么的毫无兴趣。\n我比较同意发文者的观点。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "504ba468afbe8426943664cb692ba9ef47ba5e46123dfcf04f1dd432295dcf93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
