    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb15f9da1f29b4f2deeecff6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "会变成这样，一部分原因\n也是一连串话题被网络新闻取材，\n又进一步传播出去的关系。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f4728ce44f2e19838651ca511d1e06381ced28c01382b0a4e4edbf2a58d6888",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:245af3d2ac057de677f26bd1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………你还好吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7cc35a89ec7184c9133de13042e747557ae9a7ca53e4dd6ced3fcef9da09115",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77942f9bef1b8facf322ea14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的手机突然接到来电，\n因为从画面发现是北港火山，\n我慌忙接起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "182a4161084c3a90c99d358e14822368d7672153906eae18a00202aba8db0195",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
